    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "1df672ae-b930-3f5a-a55b-8e06ef087e9d",
                "word": "Kashgar",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ae7d0a7-5715-3292-a500-71be3029331a",
                        "entry_id": "1df672ae-b930-3f5a-a55b-8e06ef087e9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A prefecture of the Xinjiang autonomous region, China."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "060c4765-ccd0-4553-b51d-a26058e85c75",
                                "sense_id": "0ae7d0a7-5715-3292-a500-71be3029331a",
                                "text": "The China Earthquake Administration (CEA) said the quake occurred in the remote Taxkorgan County area of Kashgar Prefecture at a depth of 8 km (5 miles)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b4fffad-1643-4a18-9ac7-81d4e76dfdae",
                                "sense_id": "0ae7d0a7-5715-3292-a500-71be3029331a",
                                "text": "In one year, Kashgar Prefecture, which has a population of 4 million, has carried out mandatory checks for practically its entire population, said Yang Yanfeng, deputy director of Kashgar’s propaganda department. She characterized the checkups as a public health success story, not a security measure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1a6bc07-3951-43e6-abc8-afb2243afb7c",
                                "sense_id": "0ae7d0a7-5715-3292-a500-71be3029331a",
                                "text": "In addition, in January 2019, the Hong Kong-based security services company Frontier Services Group (FSG) announced on its website that it had signed an agreement with local XUAR officials to build a training facility in Kashgar prefecture, XUAR."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb49afc4-8925-4775-8ea8-92ae7d1cc6f7",
                                "sense_id": "0ae7d0a7-5715-3292-a500-71be3029331a",
                                "text": "Authorities in Kashgar prefecture in the Xinjiang region of northwestern China say they have completed tests on more than 4.7 million residents. It follows the country's latest outbreak at the weekend."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bf5e2f6-9253-32d1-8991-9c7125e11e66",
                        "entry_id": "1df672ae-b930-3f5a-a55b-8e06ef087e9d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A county-level city of Kashgar prefecture, Xinjiang autonomous region, China."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb8e6aad-6e76-4c16-9639-baff2a95aec4",
                                "sense_id": "5bf5e2f6-9253-32d1-8991-9c7125e11e66",
                                "text": "The Province of Xenſi extends to the Kingdom of Preſter John. Caſcar and Thebet, which the Chineſes in a general Name call Sifan it is a large Province, and is divided into eight Counties, having one hundred and eighty Cities: Sigan is the Metropolis of the whole, ſeated on the River Guei, in a moſt pleaſant and delightful place, of a noble Proſpect, and good Trade."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1841a55e-03a7-4af0-8f0a-c9c0101d99ad",
                                "sense_id": "5bf5e2f6-9253-32d1-8991-9c7125e11e66",
                                "text": "The last accounts from Mr. Moncrieff left him at Cashmere. From that place he sent to ask permission of the Government of Kashgar to go to Buchara, to purchase horses. This was refused, and he was obliged to take another route and proceed through Cabul."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "574813f3-43e1-4d94-8b31-75a198307294",
                                "sense_id": "5bf5e2f6-9253-32d1-8991-9c7125e11e66",
                                "text": "The weapon steel and metalwork of Kashgar, the carpets of Khotan, the painted caves of Kezir were famed throughout Central Asia."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af832bdd-631c-468b-b333-42dd01a18c5a",
                                "sense_id": "5bf5e2f6-9253-32d1-8991-9c7125e11e66",
                                "text": "In 1990 a fight between armed locals and the police and military flared up in Baren, in Akto, near Kashgar, in which at least 22 people were killed, of whom six were members of the security forces; some sources say the locals had intended to initiate an armed uprising."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
